{title: Ishq - Lost Found}
{artist: Rauhan Malik Faheem Abdullah}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
Main [Em] aa likkhoon tu [D] aa jaaye,        Main [C] baith likkhoon tu [D] aa baithe
Mere [Em] shaane par sar [D] rakhe tu,        Main [C] neend kahoon tu [D] so jaaye
Main [Em] aa likkhoon tu [D] aa jaaye,        Main [C] baith likkhoon tu [D] aa baithe
Mere [Em] shaane par sar [D] rakhe tu,        Main [C] neend kahoon tu [D] so jaaye
Chal [Em] aa ek aesi [D] nazm kahoon,        Jo [C] lafz kahoon vo [D] ho jaaye
Main [Em] dil likhoon tu [D] dil thaame,        Main [C] gum likhoon vo [D] kho jaaye
Main [Em] aa bharun tu [D] haaye kare,        Be [C] chain likhoon be [D] chain ho tu
Phir [Em] bechaini ka [D] be kaatoon,        Tujhe [C] chain zara sa [D] ho jaaye
Abhi [Em] ain likhoon tu [D] soche mujhe,        Phir [C] sheen likhoon teri [D] neend ude
Jab [Em] qaaf likhoon tujhe [D] kuch kuch ho,        Main [C] ishq likhoon tujhe [D] ho jaaye
